# $repo_name

$org_name's knowledge source of truth — $wiki_title, an LLM-maintained wiki operated by
Claude Code and GitHub Copilot.

- **Start here:** [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) — onboarding, layout, commit convention, workflows.
  Format rules are progressively disclosed in a nested `AGENTS.md` per folder:
  [sources/](./sources/AGENTS.md) · [sources/cards/](./sources/cards/AGENTS.md) ·
  [wiki/](./wiki/AGENTS.md)
- **Catalog:** [index.md](./index.md)
- **Setup after clone:** `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`
- Without that one-time setup, commits silently skip the format check - lint reports a HOOKS error until it is configured.
- **Claude Code users:** onboarding is automatic. `CLAUDE.md` (and one nested copy per
  folder) is scaffolded and tracked for you, importing `AGENTS.md` — there is nothing to
  set up by hand. GitHub Copilot reads `AGENTS.md` natively.
- **Health check:** `python3 scripts/lint.py`
